    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the CLI in [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js). It uses only the Node.js standard library, streams the input file so it does not need to load the whole file into memory, counts characters as bytes, applies the spec\u2019s newline and whitespace rules, lowercases words for frequency counting, and writes the required JSON shape to `--output`.\n\nI verified it with sample cases for empty input, no trailing newline, trailing newline, multiple consecutive newlines, case-insensitive frequency counting with punctuation preserved, alphabetical tie-breaking in `top_words`, malformed UTF-8, missing flags, and invalid output paths. Syntax check with `node --check` also passed.\n\nFrom `/workspace`, run it as `node output/main.js --input <file> --output <json>`. From inside `output/`, the same entrypoint is `node main.js --input <file> --output <json>`.",
